     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Education on preventing STIs should start at age 10 to help ensure renal health. UTIs resulting from STIs can spread silently and asymptomatically, depending on the cause, which could lead to pyelonephritis and damage Kayla’s already weakened kidneys."
